<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>LoongBuy Image Search — Find Similar Products</title><meta name="description" content="Upload a product photo to find visually similar LoongBuy spreadsheet products in the FindSpreadsheet catalog."/><Indexing /><link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico"/></head><body><Header/><main><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A PHOTO IS A GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h1>LoongBuy <span class="gradient-text">Image Search</span></h1><p>Have a photo of something you like? Find similar shoes, clothing and accessories in the spreadsheet.</p></section><section class="section image-workspace"><div><label class="upload-box">↥<strong>Upload a product image</strong><span>JPG, PNG or WebP · up to 15 MB</span><img id="upload-preview" class="upload-preview" alt="Your selected product" hidden/><input id="image-upload" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"/></label><p id="image-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose an image to start searching.</p><p class="data-note" id="image-coverage" hidden><span>Images searched</span> <b id="image-compared">0</b> / <b id="image-total">0</b></p><button class="outline" id="reset-image" hidden>Clear image</button></div><div class="search-help"><p class="eyebrow">FROM PHOTO TO FIND</p><h2>Less guessing. More discovering.</h2><p>1. Choose a clear photo of one product.<br/>2. We compare it with indexed catalog photos, available QC photos and site images.<br/>3. Explore similar finds, then check the original listing.</p><p class="data-note">Your image is processed in your browser. Results are ranked by visual similarity. QC photos become searchable after they are included in the index.</p><a class="text-button" href="/articles/loongbuy-image-search/">Tips for better image searches ↗</a></div></section><section class="section" id="image-results"><div class="image-result-heading"><h2>Discover similar finds<span class="orange">.</span></h2><p id="results-label">Your results will appear here</p></div><div class="products" id="products"></div><div class="pagination" id="pagination"></div><p class="data-note">USD estimates · 1 USD = 6.6642 CNY · Nov 16, 2026. Confirm current prices on LoongBuy.</p></section></main><footer><a href="/">← Home</a><p class="data-note">Independent LoongBuy discovery guide · Historical FindSpreadsheet catalog</p></footer><script src="/app.js?v=logo-detail-v2" is:inline></script></body></html>
